WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.658
Validation tests values against documented rules A
rule might

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:11.713
describe a text pattern a length a domain or a
numeric range Passing

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:17.270
a rule means the value satisfies that rule It does
not necessarily

00:00:17.284 --> 00:00:23.297
prove the value is correct in the real world Keep
the distinction between validity

00:00:23.324 --> 00:00:25.166
and accuracy from Module 1
